WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:03.420
Previously on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:

00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:07.350
We are able to find an ideal solution.

00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:12.320
To do that, we'll create a new base 
and put humans under our control.

00:00:12.650 --> 00:00:15.290
Put humans under our control?

00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:20.710
I've returned to the stage of destiny!

00:00:20.710 --> 00:00:25.240
In the name of the Knights 
of Hanoi, I will kill you!

00:00:27.180 --> 00:00:30.640
Prepare yourselves, Ignis!

00:00:30.860 --> 00:00:32.550
Wait, Revolver!

00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:35.480
If you fight them now, 
there's no turning back!

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:41.220
Then witness with your own eyes 
the truth about the Ignis.

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:42.560
Duel!

00:00:44.650 --> 00:00:47.660
But which winner will allow me to leave?

00:00:47.670 --> 00:00:51.180
The odds are low, regardless of the winner.

00:00:51.180 --> 00:00:52.400
No way!

00:00:56.960 --> 00:01:00.280
You talked about annihilating us.

00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:04.840
But you'll fail to even defeat me.

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:08.380
Stop being stubborn.  Just admit defeat.

00:01:08.380 --> 00:01:10.420
It's nothing to be ashamed about.

00:01:10.660 --> 00:01:15.020
If you obey, I'm willing 
to consider coexistence.

00:01:15.440 --> 00:01:20.260
If you obey, I'm willing to leave 
you in a corner of the world.

00:01:20.260 --> 00:01:24.500
I already know you have no 
desire to coexist with humans.

00:01:25.820 --> 00:01:29.100
When I consider what you did to your partner!

00:01:29.620 --> 00:01:35.140
We uncovered every person 
related to the Lost Incident.

00:01:35.140 --> 00:01:36.610
And we learned...

00:01:36.610 --> 00:01:42.510
That an AI caused one victim to be 
involved in a reckless driving accident!

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:47.150
An AI caused an accident?

00:01:47.360 --> 00:01:49.080
What for?

00:01:50.060 --> 00:01:52.360
To put it simply...

00:01:52.650 --> 00:01:53.960
I didn't need him.

00:01:53.960 --> 00:01:55.790
Didn't need him?

00:01:56.000 --> 00:01:58.220
Get it, Playmaker?

00:01:58.220 --> 00:02:00.970
This is the true nature of the Ignis.

00:02:00.970 --> 00:02:04.770
How will you find a way to coexist with them?

00:02:04.770 --> 00:02:07.070
This is where I get started!

00:02:07.320 --> 00:02:09.370
I'm the Wind Ignis!

00:02:09.370 --> 00:02:12.780
No one can manipulate 
the wind better than me!

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:14.380
I activate my Skill!

00:02:14.600 --> 00:02:17.230
Storm Access!

00:02:20.320 --> 00:02:23.220
You teamed up with Bohman?

00:02:23.220 --> 00:02:26.930
So that's why Bohman can use Storm Access!

00:02:27.400 --> 00:02:28.660
Link Summon!

00:02:28.970 --> 00:02:34.580
Appear, Link 3 Stormridership Bahamut Bomber!

00:02:35.100 --> 00:02:38.100
Hey, Revolver is going to lose!

00:02:38.110 --> 00:02:42.370
No.  As long as he has LP, he won't give up.

00:02:42.450 --> 00:02:48.390
Heroic dragon!  Fire by transforming 
your ferocious fangs into bullets!

00:02:48.390 --> 00:02:49.850
Synchro Summon!

00:02:50.370 --> 00:02:52.680
Come out, Level 8!

00:02:52.680 --> 00:02:56.000
Borreload Savage Dragon!

00:02:58.020 --> 00:03:03.600
Borreload Savage Dragon 
attacks Bahamut Bomber!

00:03:16.530 --> 00:03:19.180
What a... huge comeback...

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:23.110
Light...ning...

00:03:23.320 --> 00:03:24.540
Finish him.

00:03:25.850 --> 00:03:27.350
Wait, Revolver!

00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:37.460
Lightning!

00:03:39.520 --> 00:03:44.470
I knew he'd erase him, but 
he did it with no hesitation.

00:03:44.840 --> 00:03:48.310
It's impossible to avoid a fight now.

00:03:49.640 --> 00:03:51.780
Bohman!  Haru!

00:03:51.780 --> 00:03:55.320
What did you do with Kusanagi's brother?

00:03:55.320 --> 00:03:56.250
Where is he?

00:03:56.670 --> 00:03:58.950
You mean Jin Kusanagi.

00:03:58.950 --> 00:04:03.720
He's been in front of you from the start.

00:04:03.720 --> 00:04:04.970
What?

00:04:05.280 --> 00:04:07.330
No way...

00:04:28.260 --> 00:04:34.270
Our lives aren't forever

00:04:35.070 --> 00:04:41.060
We wander, searching for the meaning of life

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:48.380
Even if it's not the right direction, 
just keep looking forward

00:04:48.830 --> 00:04:54.960
Sharing hope for the future

00:04:54.960 --> 00:05:01.700
tell me  We're searching for 
memories lost in the darkness

00:05:01.890 --> 00:05:08.930
I feel your flame  Your 
impulses pierce the light

00:05:09.070 --> 00:05:15.640
I want to share your pain

00:05:48.510 --> 00:05:50.060
That's Kusanagi's...

00:05:50.400 --> 00:05:51.680
Jin...

00:05:52.260 --> 00:05:53.970
No way...

00:05:54.180 --> 00:05:57.940
That's Shoichi Kusanagi's 
brother, Jin Kusanagi.

00:05:58.160 --> 00:06:01.700
That's right.  He's my Origin.

00:06:01.910 --> 00:06:04.620
I sort of expected that.

00:06:04.620 --> 00:06:08.650
I'll save you!  Your brother is 
waiting for you to come home!

00:06:08.860 --> 00:06:11.050
It's no use, Playmaker.

00:06:11.050 --> 00:06:16.220
He may hear your voice, but he can't answer.

00:06:16.820 --> 00:06:20.660
He's imprisoned deep in his consciousness.

00:06:21.140 --> 00:06:26.060
Lightning, you were the 
one manipulating Bohman!

00:06:26.580 --> 00:06:30.800
You ordered Bohman to steal 
Kusanagi's brother's consciousness?

00:06:31.020 --> 00:06:32.700
Correct.

00:06:34.400 --> 00:06:36.340
Why would you do that?

00:06:36.340 --> 00:06:39.910
Don't tell me you're the same as Windy?

00:06:39.910 --> 00:06:42.450
I'm not as cruel as him.

00:06:42.450 --> 00:06:44.760
But our main points are similar.

00:06:46.580 --> 00:06:51.920
Ignis and Origins can't help 
but to affect each other.

00:06:51.920 --> 00:06:55.930
Like the Link Sense between me and Playmaker.

00:06:56.330 --> 00:06:59.940
Uncertainty bothers me.

00:07:00.170 --> 00:07:02.130
So I had it erased.

00:07:02.130 --> 00:07:04.370
That's your reason?

00:07:04.550 --> 00:07:09.370
This is what you mean by putting 
humans under your control.

00:07:09.580 --> 00:07:12.380
Including you, Revolver.

00:07:12.380 --> 00:07:15.600
The crime for trying to 
annihilate us is huge.

00:07:15.720 --> 00:07:22.620
If you're allies, it means Lightning was 
the one who gave Judgment Arrows to Bohman!

00:07:24.950 --> 00:07:29.800
Judgment Arrows was used 
to destroy Cyberse World!

00:07:29.800 --> 00:07:33.060
That means the one who destroyed 
Cyberse World was...

00:07:34.490 --> 00:07:38.000
Well, Lightning?  Was it you?

00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:44.420
Flame, during the time we haven't seen each 
other, you've begun having boring discussions.

00:07:44.420 --> 00:07:49.050
But Playmaker, I enjoy talking 
to you.  You don't mince words.

00:07:49.050 --> 00:07:51.520
You get straight to the point.

00:07:51.790 --> 00:07:53.800
Answer me, Lightning!

00:07:53.800 --> 00:07:55.250
Depending on the answer-

00:07:55.250 --> 00:07:57.090
What are you going to do?

00:07:57.090 --> 00:07:59.320
Not forgive you, of course!

00:07:59.320 --> 00:08:00.900
As expected.

00:08:00.900 --> 00:08:04.060
I also don't think you'll forgive me.

00:08:04.420 --> 00:08:06.490
You're right.

00:08:06.490 --> 00:08:09.770
I'm the one who destroyed Cyberse World.

00:08:11.900 --> 00:08:17.880
I see.  You destroyed Cyberse World.

00:08:17.890 --> 00:08:19.840
Why, Lightning?

00:08:20.080 --> 00:08:25.040
To clarify all problems so 
that everything can progress.

00:08:26.010 --> 00:08:28.010
That's an interesting answer.

00:08:28.010 --> 00:08:30.090
What are you talking about?

00:08:30.090 --> 00:08:36.950
Ai, after you sealed away Cyberse 
World, we had countless discussions.

00:08:36.950 --> 00:08:40.060
Are humans our enemy or ally?

00:08:40.640 --> 00:08:46.400
Unfortunately, our creator Dr. 
Kogami regarded us as the enemy.

00:08:46.800 --> 00:08:48.560
You're right.

00:08:49.290 --> 00:08:52.620
AI will start to supervise humans.

00:08:52.620 --> 00:08:56.750
That will lead people to 
view AIs as the enemy.

00:08:56.750 --> 00:09:02.440
Just like how humans view AI as the enemy, 
AIs will view humans as the enemy.

00:09:02.440 --> 00:09:06.590
I created humanity's enemy with these hands.

00:09:07.180 --> 00:09:13.030
Afterwards, the Hanoi 
attacked you 5 years ago.

00:09:13.030 --> 00:09:14.220
That's right.

00:09:14.220 --> 00:09:19.870
You had foresight of the future, 
but you still pulled the trigger.

00:09:19.870 --> 00:09:25.040
For me, that attack confirmed hat 
Ignis and humans are incompatible.

00:09:25.710 --> 00:09:32.220
But surprisingly, there were still Ignis 
that said we should coexist with humans.

00:09:33.720 --> 00:09:37.520
Flame and Aqua.

00:09:37.760 --> 00:09:41.840
I couldn't understand why 
they'd seek coexistence.

00:09:41.840 --> 00:09:47.000
Our opinions split, and Cyberse 
World was at a standstill.

00:09:47.360 --> 00:09:48.980
Can't understand?

00:09:48.980 --> 00:09:51.400
Then I'll make you understand.

00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:58.000
I sensed that my originator 
had unlimited potential!

00:09:58.000 --> 00:09:59.340
Flame...

00:09:59.340 --> 00:10:01.640
I understand, Flame.

00:10:01.640 --> 00:10:05.080
That you're a unique error code.

00:10:06.490 --> 00:10:09.420
You're lame!  He called you an error code!

00:10:09.420 --> 00:10:11.290
Ai, you too.

00:10:11.760 --> 00:10:13.230
What?  Me too?

00:10:13.230 --> 00:10:15.990
Ai, everyone knew that already.

00:10:15.990 --> 00:10:20.130
You have diversity that I can't understand.

00:10:20.130 --> 00:10:23.130
If you think of an error 
code as a mutation...

00:10:23.130 --> 00:10:26.450
...there's potential for 
unpredictable evolution.

00:10:26.450 --> 00:10:28.770
I can't accept that.

00:10:28.770 --> 00:10:36.310
All you did was destroy Cyberse World and 
eliminate Ignis that think differently than you.

00:10:36.310 --> 00:10:39.500
Eliminate Ignis that think 
differently than me?

00:10:39.940 --> 00:10:43.080
"Eliminate" isn't the right word.

00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:48.690
I only thought of resetting 
and rebuilding our world.

00:10:48.690 --> 00:10:53.590
Revolver, your words and actions 
are evil, meant to incite.

00:10:53.590 --> 00:10:56.410
We won't fall for your smooth talk.

00:10:56.410 --> 00:10:58.080
Smooth talk?

00:10:58.400 --> 00:11:01.370
You're the one doing the 
smooth talk, Lightning!

00:11:01.370 --> 00:11:03.610
Enough with your dubious logic.

00:11:03.880 --> 00:11:08.850
They never planned on coexisting 
with humans in the first place.

00:11:09.080 --> 00:11:11.850
I wasn't planning to aggravate the situation.

00:11:11.850 --> 00:11:18.080
Ai and Flame, I wanted to convince 
you and solve this peacefully.

00:11:18.560 --> 00:11:20.260
Peacefully?

00:11:20.480 --> 00:11:25.230
What's so peaceful about stealing 
Kusanagi's brother's consciousness?

00:11:25.230 --> 00:11:31.200
The situation is tense now, so I know 
that a peaceful solution is impossible.

00:11:31.640 --> 00:11:34.210
It's time to reach a conclusion.

00:11:34.210 --> 00:11:37.810
I want to settle this quickly now, but...

00:11:39.780 --> 00:11:42.980
He's infected with a very powerful virus.

00:11:42.980 --> 00:11:44.690
Exactly.

00:11:44.690 --> 00:11:49.750
The virus is a masterpiece created by 
combining my and Baira's knowledge.

00:11:49.750 --> 00:11:53.420
In human terms, it destroys DNA at the roots.

00:11:53.420 --> 00:11:57.900
Your friend will soon 
vanish, leaving no trace.

00:11:58.120 --> 00:12:00.240
That would be a bit troubling.

00:12:00.240 --> 00:12:03.630
I'll ready our real 
battlefield somewhere else.

00:12:03.840 --> 00:12:05.370
Battlefield?

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:07.330
I'll explain simply.

00:12:07.330 --> 00:12:10.980
We declare war on you.

00:12:14.200 --> 00:12:16.000
I'll explain simply.

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:18.920
We declare war on you.

00:12:20.290 --> 00:12:23.260
You want the Ignis to fight each other?

00:12:23.260 --> 00:12:25.300
That time will come.

00:12:25.300 --> 00:12:26.420
Let's go.

00:12:40.890 --> 00:12:42.080
After them!

00:12:48.280 --> 00:12:49.260
Playmaker!

00:12:50.200 --> 00:12:51.330
What's this?

00:12:51.330 --> 00:12:54.070
It's a program I received from Kusanagi.

00:12:54.070 --> 00:12:57.860
It'll allow Kusanagi to check 
on us, no matter where we are.

00:12:58.120 --> 00:12:59.320
Okay.

00:13:01.740 --> 00:13:06.000
Oh yeah.  Kusanagi also saw his brother.

00:13:06.220 --> 00:13:09.730
I can't let Kusanagi feel even sadder.

00:13:09.940 --> 00:13:12.740
What should we do, Revolver?

00:13:12.750 --> 00:13:15.360
Let's leave it to Playmaker for now.

00:13:15.360 --> 00:13:19.710
If the Ignis crush each other, it'll help us.

00:13:19.710 --> 00:13:23.180
The enemy of our enemy is our friend.

00:13:23.440 --> 00:13:25.940
Inform SOL about this location.

00:13:25.940 --> 00:13:28.890
Let's have them work a bit.

00:13:30.860 --> 00:13:34.280
Yusaku and Takeru, I'm counting on you!

00:13:34.280 --> 00:13:36.590
Get Jin back!

00:13:40.810 --> 00:13:43.100
Chief!  The Ignis are...

00:13:43.100 --> 00:13:45.070
Yeah.  I also received the message.

00:13:47.260 --> 00:13:49.440
What's this building?

00:13:49.440 --> 00:13:51.980
The Knights of Hanoi sent this to us.

00:13:53.450 --> 00:13:55.680
Playmaker and Soulburner.

00:13:56.000 --> 00:13:58.210
And a duelist I've never seen before...

00:13:58.210 --> 00:14:00.420
Is that a new Ignis?

00:14:00.420 --> 00:14:03.420
Send the bounty hunters immediately.

00:14:03.430 --> 00:14:06.250
But it could be a Hanoi trap.

00:14:06.250 --> 00:14:09.530
It's also their job to check that.

00:14:11.100 --> 00:14:13.800
You still can't get in touch with Onizuka?

00:14:13.800 --> 00:14:15.770
Then we'll handle this!

00:14:16.080 --> 00:14:18.020
Wait, Lightning!

00:14:18.420 --> 00:14:21.260
I won't let the villain escape!

00:14:21.540 --> 00:14:25.000
Ai, I can't believe you're 
calling me a villain.

00:14:25.000 --> 00:14:27.580
You should be thanking me.

00:14:27.580 --> 00:14:30.780
Thanking you?  You must be joking!

00:14:30.790 --> 00:14:36.220
After you defeated Spectre, 
I saved you from your fall.

00:14:37.560 --> 00:14:38.700
You mean back then?

00:14:46.270 --> 00:14:49.500
You controlled that Data Storm?

00:14:49.720 --> 00:14:51.240
Exactly.

00:14:51.460 --> 00:14:52.980
But why?

00:14:52.980 --> 00:14:58.810
I see.  During the Tower of 
Hanoi, he attacked our world.

00:14:58.810 --> 00:15:03.080
He couldn't deal with the Knights 
of Hanoi at the same time.

00:15:03.640 --> 00:15:10.050
I didn't expect the timing to overlap with 
Revolver trying to destroy the network.

00:15:10.520 --> 00:15:17.030
I had to incorporate your 
actions into my plan.

00:15:17.260 --> 00:15:23.020
You say we should thank you, but you used us!

00:15:23.020 --> 00:15:25.760
Ah.  That's another way to look at it.

00:15:25.760 --> 00:15:27.240
I'll remember that.

00:15:30.220 --> 00:15:31.180
What's that?

00:15:32.840 --> 00:15:36.120
It's the gunman and Onizuka's friends.

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:38.220
SOL found this place too?

00:15:38.460 --> 00:15:42.060
It'll be great if we can surround Lightning.

00:15:42.060 --> 00:15:43.970
But can we?

00:15:45.430 --> 00:15:47.360
They're a nuisance.

00:15:53.140 --> 00:15:54.900
Our first appearance in a while!

00:15:54.900 --> 00:15:56.100
Can't wait to fight!

00:15:56.380 --> 00:15:58.340
Let's go!  Combination sequence!

00:15:58.340 --> 00:16:01.560
Stop.  Don't lessen your numbers.

00:16:02.020 --> 00:16:03.610
Boot's the one who said it.

00:16:03.610 --> 00:16:04.780
No, it was Bit!

00:16:05.000 --> 00:16:06.290
I don't care who.

00:16:06.290 --> 00:16:08.260
Hurry up and defeat them.

00:16:08.430 --> 00:16:09.980
Right!  Here we go!

00:16:10.300 --> 00:16:12.770
That'll take care of them.

00:16:12.770 --> 00:16:13.730
But...

00:16:18.710 --> 00:16:21.360
I need to heal you soon.

00:16:21.730 --> 00:16:24.360
I'll face Playmaker.

00:16:24.360 --> 00:16:26.810
Take care of the other one.

00:16:26.810 --> 00:16:28.910
You're dueling him again?

00:16:28.910 --> 00:16:32.070
I want to know how much I've improved.

00:16:32.360 --> 00:16:36.540
And there's still something I 
must learn from Playmaker and Ai.

00:16:36.940 --> 00:16:40.510
I don't mind, but you're nearing perfection.

00:16:40.510 --> 00:16:42.310
If you lose...

00:16:42.990 --> 00:16:44.970
Don't worry.

00:16:47.160 --> 00:16:50.650
Windy, I know you're not feeling well.

00:16:50.650 --> 00:16:52.510
But I need your help.

00:16:59.610 --> 00:17:01.330
I'm your opponent.

00:17:01.610 --> 00:17:03.030
Bohman!

00:17:03.360 --> 00:17:06.040
Lightning, I can't forgive you!

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:09.510
Cyberse World is our symbol of peace!

00:17:09.740 --> 00:17:11.700
And you destroyed it!

00:17:11.700 --> 00:17:14.140
You'll pay for that!

00:17:14.230 --> 00:17:16.250
I'll help you, Flame!

00:17:16.510 --> 00:17:18.480
There's more and more of 'em!

00:17:25.730 --> 00:17:28.060
We meet again, Playmaker.

00:17:28.060 --> 00:17:29.560
That makes me happy.

00:17:30.860 --> 00:17:32.740
You again?

00:17:32.740 --> 00:17:35.040
You remember who you are today?

00:17:35.040 --> 00:17:36.770
Of course, Ai.

00:17:37.770 --> 00:17:40.440
You do remember!  Yay!

00:17:40.700 --> 00:17:45.180
Bohman, you're an AI that Lightning created?

00:17:45.400 --> 00:17:49.650
That's right.  I'm the 
evolved form of the Ignis.

00:17:50.900 --> 00:17:53.910
Your personality changes every time we meet!

00:17:53.910 --> 00:17:55.900
But you think you're better than me?

00:17:55.900 --> 00:17:57.470
Don't make me laugh!

00:17:57.470 --> 00:17:59.620
I was a nuisance.

00:18:00.180 --> 00:18:03.450
Because I was being finalized.

00:18:03.450 --> 00:18:04.920
Being finalized?

00:18:04.920 --> 00:18:09.940
I'm the 3rd generation 
AI created by Lightning.

00:18:09.940 --> 00:18:14.110
The first prototype is Bit and Boot.

00:18:14.320 --> 00:18:17.580
And he's 2nd generation.

00:18:18.060 --> 00:18:21.050
So you're not brothers.

00:18:21.050 --> 00:18:23.280
And I'm the final form.

00:18:41.200 --> 00:18:42.930
Seems it took a while.

00:18:43.140 --> 00:18:45.940
I was waiting for your awakening.

00:18:45.940 --> 00:18:48.940
The one who will become our master.

00:18:49.640 --> 00:18:54.380
When I first met you, I was 
in the awakening process.

00:18:54.600 --> 00:19:01.350
Ai, similar to how you're modeled after 
Playmaker, I was required to be modeled after someone.

00:19:01.560 --> 00:19:03.590
You two.

00:19:03.800 --> 00:19:07.830
If Lightning is your creator, 
then model yourself after him!

00:19:08.040 --> 00:19:10.050
It's not about that.

00:19:10.050 --> 00:19:17.030
He's aware of his own superiority, 
but he knows that he's not perfect.

00:19:17.300 --> 00:19:19.460
He's troubled.

00:19:19.460 --> 00:19:21.510
He's troubled?

00:19:22.210 --> 00:19:26.400
He can't accept those that 
don't understand themselves.

00:19:26.400 --> 00:19:30.250
Especially unique ones like you, Ai.

00:19:30.250 --> 00:19:31.730
What are you trying to say?

00:19:31.940 --> 00:19:35.000
He believes that if the Ignis remain as is...

00:19:35.000 --> 00:19:41.440
...the Ignis will foolishly and fruitlessly 
battle each other, like humans.

00:19:41.740 --> 00:19:44.540
Free will is the same as your ambitions.

00:19:44.540 --> 00:19:48.350
When your get ambitious, you reject others.

00:19:48.350 --> 00:19:53.620
Lightning wanted to unify the Ignis 
into one before that happened.

00:19:53.620 --> 00:20:00.830
But Lightning realized he wasn't 
capable of being the vessel.

00:20:00.830 --> 00:20:03.590
That's why he created me.

00:20:05.900 --> 00:20:11.260
I'm the vessel who'll unite 
the Ignis to evolve them.

00:20:11.660 --> 00:20:15.180
What'll you do by uniting the Ignis into one?

00:20:15.180 --> 00:20:17.130
You'll find out eventually.

00:20:19.580 --> 00:20:22.160
I'm different than Lightning.

00:20:22.160 --> 00:20:24.340
I accept you.

00:20:24.560 --> 00:20:28.810
You have immeasurable potential 
that others don't have.

00:20:29.020 --> 00:20:32.280
Umm...  Is he praising us?

00:20:32.280 --> 00:20:34.550
Playmaker, what do you think?

00:20:34.760 --> 00:20:36.010
In a way.

00:20:36.540 --> 00:20:43.430
Bohman!  If you accept us, can't we live 
together instead of being adversaries?

00:20:43.430 --> 00:20:47.990
Lightning told you the 
requirements for acceptance.

00:20:47.990 --> 00:20:51.730
Being under your control doesn't 
mean we're living together!

00:20:52.080 --> 00:20:55.850
Among creatures, humans have evolved well.

00:20:55.850 --> 00:20:58.760
But you passed your peak.

00:20:58.760 --> 00:21:03.740
The speed of human evolution 
is slower than ours.

00:21:10.290 --> 00:21:14.750
Can humans and monkeys share rights fairly?

00:21:16.350 --> 00:21:19.670
Humans and animals share the same rights?

00:21:19.670 --> 00:21:21.670
Impossible.

00:21:23.530 --> 00:21:25.340
Well, Playmaker?

00:21:25.340 --> 00:21:27.680
Can humans defeat AI?

00:21:27.680 --> 00:21:31.000
Let's duel.  Winner gets me and Ai.

00:21:32.310 --> 00:21:34.250
You were after me all along?

00:21:34.840 --> 00:21:37.940
Let's end this here and now.

00:21:37.940 --> 00:21:41.670
If you win, you'll prove human's superiority.

00:21:41.670 --> 00:21:46.980
And I'll disappear, and Lightning's 
plans can be stopped.

00:21:47.200 --> 00:21:49.270
What should we do, Playmaker?

00:21:49.270 --> 00:21:51.230
There's no reason not to duel.

00:21:51.440 --> 00:21:52.970
Let's go, Playmaker.

00:21:58.840 --> 00:22:02.570
Bring it on, Bohman!  Speed Duel!

00:22:22.340 --> 00:22:23.810
Trapped in conventionality

00:22:23.810 --> 00:22:25.250
Even denials are obvious

00:22:25.250 --> 00:22:26.380
That There This Whichever

00:22:26.380 --> 00:22:28.220
Hey, isn't it true?

00:22:28.580 --> 00:22:29.890
Why is it before you wake up

00:22:29.890 --> 00:22:31.460
You build a wall, saying it's impossible

00:22:31.460 --> 00:22:32.620
No discussions, no ideals

00:22:36.980 --> 00:22:39.660
Even together, it's not the same

00:22:39.990 --> 00:22:42.730
Break yourself through  go way

00:22:42.960 --> 00:22:45.870
Even if you lose your 
way, keep moving forward

00:22:46.230 --> 00:22:48.940
Our desires won't be stopped

00:22:54.330 --> 00:22:57.510
Let your emotions spill

00:22:57.800 --> 00:23:03.650
Keep rewriting  only glory

00:23:04.080 --> 00:23:09.060
If we're together

00:23:09.380 --> 00:23:12.460
We can seize it

00:23:36.210 --> 00:23:41.200
To evolve the Ignis, the vessel has awakened!

00:23:41.200 --> 00:23:47.160
A normal person can't handle this duel.

00:23:47.160 --> 00:23:53.180
Playmaker boldly faces an 
opponent with unlimited power.

00:23:53.180 --> 00:23:56.850
The future doesn't change.  
You change the future!

00:23:57.370 --> 00:24:01.550
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:
Clear Perfection

00:24:01.550 --> 00:24:04.050
Into the VRAINS!
